cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Bio-USD, please cite it as below and name the version you wrote to."
title: "Bio-USD: a convention for biological cells on OpenUSD"
version: 0.1.2
date-released: 2026-10-23
license: Apache-2.0
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Walker
    given-names: David
    affiliation: "eyentelligence inc."
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-3482-6181"
abstract: >-
  A convention for carrying a population of biological cells in an OpenUSD
  stage as a PointInstancer with per-instance primvars, including a Cell
  Ontology / NCI Thesaurus term per cell for interoperability with
  single-cell atlases. Adds no prim types; any OpenUSD tool reads it.
keywords:
  - OpenUSD
  - Cell Ontology
  - multicellular simulation
  - visualization
  - digital twin
